# Autonomous Delivery

This optional package coordinates one already human-prioritized and
architecturally authorized task through the existing long-running-work,
transaction, project-check, work-completion, and Continuation boundaries.

It owns no task purpose, architecture, release policy, validation evidence, or
standing permission. An independently confirmed external authorization record
must cover every exact effect plan. The worker may not write its authorization,
confirmation, revocation, or emergency-stop records.

Repository-local transactions may be exactly reversible. Commits and
unpublished task branches are recoverable. Pushes, merges, tags, workflow
dispatches, and GitHub Releases are monotonic effects: inspect before acting,
record receipts, read back, reconcile, and fix forward. An unknown outcome
stops with zero automatic retries.

Direct external spending is always zero. The external worker or provider host
must enforce the accepted AI/provider compute ceilings.
